200%"><span lang="EN-GB">APPEAL from a judgment of the Saskatchewan Court of Appeal (Vancise, Sherstobitoff and Lane&nbsp;JJ.A.), 2007 SKCA 57, 293 Sask. R. 187, 397 W.A.C. 187, 282 D.L.R. (4th) 1, [2007] 7 W.W.R. 577, 49 C.C.L.T. (3d) 194, [2007] S.J. No.&nbsp;247 (QL), 2007 CarswellSask 237, upholding the judgment of Baynton&nbsp;J., 2003 SKQB 559, 244 Sask. R. 1, 234 D.L.R. (4th) 612, [2004] 9 W.W.R. 647, [2003] S.J. No.&nbsp;830 (QL), 2003 CarswellSask 898.&nbsp; Appeal allowed.</span></p>
