 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:57.6pt;line-height:
200%"><i><span lang="EN-GB">Eugene&nbsp;B.</span></i><span lang="EN-GB"> <i>Szach</i>, for the intervener the Attorney General of Manitoba.</span></p>
